{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 23, :comments ["<b>A sabbath of rest, a holy sabbath to YHWH tomorrow.</b> By way of the plain sense (peshat): he doubled the name of Sabbath, for so all the matters of the Sabbath are doubled — in the omer, the offering, and the psalm." "<b>And by way of</b> the Kabbalah: 'a sabbath of rest, a holy sabbath to YHWH tomorrow' — it is to say: the sabbath-rest of tomorrow corresponds to the sabbath of the supernal beings, which is 'a sabbath of rest, a holy sabbath to YHWH.'"], :book :exodus, :voice :rabbeinu-bahya, :lang :en, :chapter 16, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:00:06.520333562Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}